B.a2=new A.af(B.Hh,["Patient Access","Patient Access","\u0627\u0644\u0639\u0631\u0628\u064a\u0629","Menu","OK","Cancel","Confirm","Save","Send","Add","Open","Close","Back","Next","Try again","All","Unknown","Required","Could not load. Check your connection and try again.","Something went wrong. Please try again.","Could not save. Please try again.","Could not send. Please try again.","The site is not connected to the server yet.","Choose a date","Male","Female","Age","Sex","{n} years","Date of birth","Email","Check the email address.","Mobile","Check the phone number.","Password","Confirm password","At least 8 characters.","The passwords do not match.","Full name","Governorate","All governorates","City / district","Address","National ID number (14 digits)","Member no.","Patient no.","Clinic","Hospital","Clinic / hospital","Doctor","Manager","Notes","Diagnosis","Blood","Blood type","recorded","Search by name or patient number","Home","My medical file","Clinic / hospital","Pharmacy","Admin","Clinics & pharmacies","Join","Hello {n}","Hello","Sign in","Sign out","Your medical file, safe and with you everywhere","One file for each patient. Your doctor opens it only with your permission, writes an e-prescription, and the pharmacy dispenses it once.","Create your file","Go to my account","Opens only with your permission","Every opening is logged","Verified doctors & pharmacies","One platform for three partners in care","Patients and families","Your history, allergies, chronic illnesses and medicines in one place.","Your children's files under your account until they turn 18.","You decide who sees your file, and you can take access away at any time.","Clinics and hospitals","The patient's full history in seconds, with a code or a QR from the patient.","Visits, diagnoses and vital signs recorded and never lost.","Clear e-prescriptions with no handwriting mistakes.","Pharmacies","Scan the prescription QR and see the medicines and doses.","Each prescription is dispensed only once, so it cannot be reused.","Free for pharmacies.","How it works","The patient gives permission","At the clinic, show a QR or read out a 6-digit code. It works once and expires in 10 minutes.","The doctor writes","The doctor sees your history, records the visit, and writes the prescription in your file.","The pharmacy dispenses once","Show the prescription QR at any member pharmacy. After dispensing it cannot be used again.","Your privacy comes first","No doctor or hospital sees your file without a code from you.","You see who opened your file and when, and you can take access away.","Medical records cannot be edited or deleted. Mistakes are fixed with a clear correction.","The platform's administrators do not see medical records.","In an emergency, call the ambulance on 123.","Sign in","Welcome back","Wrong email or password, or the email is not confirmed yet.","Forgot your password?","No account yet?","Already have an account?","Create an account","Create your account","Patients, doctors, nurses and pharmacists all start here. Next you confirm your identity.","Create account","We could not create the account. The email may already be used.","Too many requests right now. Please try again in an hour.","Confirm your email","We sent a message to {email}. Open it and tap the link, then sign in.","I agree to the "," and the ","Please agree to the terms and the privacy policy.","Terms of use","Privacy policy","The Arabic version is the binding one.","Reset your password","Enter your email and we will send you a link to set a new password.","Send the link","If this email has an account, the link is on its way.","New password","Choose a new password for your account.","Save the password","Your password was changed.","Could not change the password. Open the link again.","Are you still there?","To protect medical data, you will be signed out in {s} seconds.","Stay signed in","You were signed out after 15 minutes without activity.","Verify your identity","Confirm your identity","Medical files need real identities. Your data is used only for this and is never shown to others.","Sign in first","Account","Details","Mobile","Consent","Who are you?","Patient","A file for you and your children. Active immediately.","Doctor, nurse or clinic staff","Work at a clinic or hospital. Reviewed by our team.","Pharmacist","Dispense e-prescriptions. Reviewed by our team.","Your details, exactly as on your national ID","Full name (as on the ID)","At least three names","Write at least three names.","The national ID number is not valid.","You must be 18 or older. Children are added from a parent's account.","This national ID number is already registered.","Choose the governorate.","Enter your syndicate registration number.","Please accept both consents to continue.","Medical syndicate no.","Pharmacists syndicate no.","Specialty","e.g. Internal medicine, Paediatrics, Nursing","Confirm your mobile on WhatsApp","Tap the button: WhatsApp opens with a message ready. Just tap Send, and the number you send from becomes your confirmed mobile.","Confirm on WhatsApp","Open WhatsApp again","Waiting for your message...","Mobile {p} is confirmed.","My Patient Access confirmation code: {c}","Mobile confirmation is not available yet. Please try again later.","Could not start the confirmation. Try again.","Too many attempts today. Try again tomorrow.","Confirm your mobile first.","This mobile is already used by another account.","Review and consent","I explicitly agree that Patient Access stores and processes my health data (and my children's), and shows it only to clinics and hospitals I give access to, and to pharmacies for prescriptions I present.","Our team checks your syndicate registration within 1-2 working days. We may ask for a photo of your syndicate card.","Confirm and send","Your request is under review","We are checking your details and will email you within 1-2 working days.","We need a little more","Our team asked for the following. Reply here, or send the document to our email if asked.","Your reply","Your request was not accepted","The reason is below. Contact us if you think this is a mistake.","Your account is suspended","Contact us to know more.","Your account is active","Welcome to Patient Access.","Continue","This page is not available for your account type.","My medical file","Your file and your children's. Open a file, or share it with a doctor.","My file","Child","Children's files","Add your children under 18. You manage their files until they turn 18; then they can join with their own national ID and take their file.","Add a child","The child's national ID number is on the birth certificate.","Child's national ID number","This person is 18 or older and must join with their own account.","This child is already registered (perhaps by the other parent).","You cannot open this file.","Back to my files","Share with doctor","Summary","Visits","History","Prescriptions","Access","Allergy","Chronic illness","Regular medicine","Surgery","Vaccination","Family history","Other","Allergies","Chronic illnesses","Regular medicines","Nothing recorded.","Prescriptions to dispense","No prescriptions waiting.","Last visit","No visits recorded yet.","No prescriptions yet.","Added by the patient","Correction","Corrected later","Add a correction","Records are never edited or deleted. Your correction is saved as a new entry linked to the old one.",'What you add is labelled "Added by the patient" so doctors know its source.',"Add my information","Add to history","Record a visit","Type","Title","Details","Date (optional)","e.g. Penicillin","e.g. Type 2 diabetes","e.g. Metformin 500 mg twice daily","e.g. Appendectomy","e.g. Hepatitis B, 3rd dose","e.g. Father: heart disease","Short title","Reason for visit","Vital signs (optional)","BP","BP systolic","BP diastolic","Pulse","Temp \xb0C","Weight kg","Height cm","SpO\u2082 %","Glucose mg/dL","You do not have access to this file now.","Check the date.","Give a clinic access","Give the code (with your patient number) or show the QR to the clinic or hospital. It opens your file for them and works once within 10 minutes.","Code","QR","Show a code","Show a QR","Expires in","Works once. You can take access away later from the Access tab.","Too many codes today. Try again tomorrow.","Who can see this file","Doctors and nurses at these places can open the file and add to it. Take access away when you no longer need it.","No clinic or hospital has access now.","since","Take access away","Take access away?","{f} will no longer be able to open this file. What they recorded stays in the file.","Activity log","No activity yet.","Access given","File opened","Record added","Prescription written","Access taken away","Prescription dispensed","Prescription","Ready to dispense","Dispensed","Cancelled","Expired","Contains a controlled (table) drug","Table drug","valid until","Dispensed at {p} on {d}","Reason","Show the QR to the pharmacy","Cancel prescription","To get your medicines, open a prescription and show its QR at any member pharmacy. Each prescription is dispensed once.","Prescription QR","The pharmacist scans this code. After dispensing it cannot be used again.","This prescription has a table drug: the pharmacist will ask for the last 4 digits of the patient's national ID.","Write prescription","Medicine","Add another medicine","Medicine name and strength","e.g. Amoxicillin 500 mg","Dose","How often","For how long","Note","Controlled (table) drug","Narcotic or psychotropic: valid for fewer days, and the pharmacy checks the patient's ID.","Diagnosis (not shown to the pharmacy)","Notes for the patient and pharmacy","Issue prescription","Add at least one medicine name.","Issue this prescription?","It will be added to {p}'s file and cannot be edited. You can cancel it until it is dispensed.","It contains a table drug. It will be added to {p}'s file, cannot be edited, and the pharmacy will check the patient's ID.","Clinic / hospital portal","You are not part of a clinic or hospital on Patient Access yet.","Work at a registered clinic or hospital?","Give the manager your member number. They add you from their staff list.","Register your clinic or hospital","You become its manager. Our team reviews the licence, then the place is active with a free trial.","Register a clinic or hospital","Details as on the licence.","Register another place","Name","Licence number","Phone","Your role there","Clinics and hospitals pay a yearly subscription. The price will be announced soon; you start with a free trial.","Send for review","Sent. We will email you after the review.","You already have requests under review.","Under review by our team. You will receive an email when it is active.","This place is suspended. Contact us.","The subscription ended on {d}. Renew it to open files again.","Active until {d}","Doctor","Nurse","Staff","Open a patient's file","Ask the patient for their patient number and the 6-digit code from their account, or scan their QR.","Open file","Scan patient QR","Enter the patient number and the 6-digit code.","The code is wrong, used or expired. Ask the patient for a new one.","This QR is not valid, used or expired.","Done. The patient is now on your list; a doctor or nurse can open the file.","Patients who gave you access","No patients yet.","Staff","Add staff","Enter their member number (they find it in their account). They must have a verified clinician account.","Also a manager","{n} was added.","No verified clinician has this member number.","Remove from staff","{n} will no longer be able to open files here.","Add another manager before you leave.","You no longer have access to this file.","Back to the clinic","Patient access QR","Doctors and nurses: sign in to open this patient's file.","This code is for clinics and hospitals. Patients show it to their doctor.","Open the file at:","Register your pharmacy","Free for pharmacies. Our team checks the licence first.","Pharmacy name","Pharmacy licence number","Pharmacist in charge","Under review. You will receive an email when it is active.","This pharmacy is suspended. Contact us.","Dispense a prescription","Scan the QR on the patient's phone. You will see the medicines and doses, and the patient's name and age.","Scan prescription QR","Or paste the prescription link","This is not a prescription QR.","Dispensed by this pharmacy","Nothing dispensed yet.","This prescription was not found.","Table drug: check the patient's identity","Ask for the patient's national ID (or the child's birth certificate) and type its last 4 digits.","Last 4 digits of the national ID","Type the last 4 digits of the national ID.","The digits do not match the patient's national ID.","Dispense","Confirm that you dispensed this prescription to {p}. It cannot be dispensed again.","Dispensed. The patient was notified.","Scan another prescription","The camera is not available. Allow camera access, or paste the link below.","Or paste the link","Link","Member clinics, hospitals and pharmacies","Places that use Patient Access, by governorate.","Clinics & hospitals","Pharmacies","None here yet.","Accounts","Clinics & hospitals","Pharmacies","Nothing here.","Approve","Reject","Ask for more","Suspend","Restore","This note is emailed to the member.","Sent","Subscription until","Set subscription end","Under review","Needs more","Active","Rejected","Suspended","Pending"],t.w)
